        "type": "comment",
        "position": {"x": -420, "y": -80},
        "positionAbsolute": {"x": -420, "y": -80},
        "data": {
          "title": "Structured Output / Schema Determinism",
          "text": "Tests whether models produce valid JSON with no markdown fences, no trailing commas, and correct key names.\n\nSimple evaluator: response must start with '{' (no preamble).\nInspect node: verify field names and types manually.\n\nEnterprise relevance: downstream parsers (n8n, LangGraph, DBs) crash on malformed JSON."
        },
        "dragHandle": ".node-header"
      },
      {
        "width": 500,
        "height": 500,
